      "code": "def build_agent(sandbox):\n    # Create a lightweight beam in the build zone\n    beam = sandbox.add_beam(x=20.0, y=7.5, width=0.1, height=0.1, density=3000.0)\n    \n    # Anchor the beam to the floor and ceiling at multiple points along its length\n    # The beam is 2 meters long (x=19.0 to x=21.0), and we'll place 20 joints\n    # Every 0.1 m along the beam's length\n    for i in range(20):\n        x_position = 20.0 - 1.0 + (i * 0.1)  # from 19.0 to 21.0\n        y_position = 7.5  # center of the beam's horizontal position\n        # Anchor to floor or ceiling based on even/odd index\n        if i % 2 == 0:\n            # Anchor to floor\n            sandbox.add_joint(body_a=beam, body_b=None, anchor_point=(x_position, 0.0), type='rigid')\n        else:\n            # Anchor to ceiling\n            sandbox.add_joint(body_a=beam, body_b=None, anchor_point=(x_position, 9.5), type='rigid')\n    \n    return beam\n\ndef agent_action(sandbox, agent_body, step_count):\n    # No action needed; the structure is statically anchored and stable\n    pass",
